OL,3,AScientists discover why Kent meningitis
OL,4,Aoutbreak was so severe
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists say they have discovered why
OL,7,Fthe bacteria responsible for the UK's
OL,8,Fworst outbreak of meningitis B in Kent
OL,9,Fearlier this year proved so dangerous.
OL,11,FMore than 20 young people, mostly
OL,12,Fstudents, were infected in the March
OL,13,Foutbreak, linked to a Canterbury
OL,14,Fnightclub. All needed hospital
OL,15,Ftreatment, while nine ended up in
OL,16,Fintensive care and two died.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
