OL,3,AScientists discover why Kent meningitis
OL,4,Aoutbreak was so severe
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts at the UK Health Security
OL,7,FAgency (UKHSA) and the University of
OL,8,FOxford, who have looked at the DNA of
OL,9,Fthe bacterium, say it picked up some
OL,10,Fgenetic material from other bugs found
OL,11,Fnaturally in the throats of some
OL,12,Fpeople.
OL,14,FThis exchange created a new strain or
OL,15,Fvariant that then spread between
OL,16,Fclubbers and caused severe illness.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
